the journey that you're on is a course. 'I've\h
just started my English course.' 'My course in\h\h

78
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:06,320
next year. If you're in a car race or a horse\h
race or playing golf, then you're going round\h\h

79
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:12,880
